    "title": "MICROSERVICE-batchinsertion-List Rideshare Rides Historys-v5-spec",
    "description": "The Rideshare Ride History API provides access to the historical records of rideshare journeys, allowing users to retrieve a comprehensive list of past rides. This API is essential for applications that need to offer users insights into their rides, helping them track usage patterns, analyze costs, and manage their rideshare activities. Typical consumers of this API include rideshare platforms, mobile applications, and analytical tools that enhance user engagement through ride history management. Developers can leverage this endpoint to build features that improve user experience based on their rideshare history.",
